# .claude/p4 — what git keeps is what the store's models train on (phi_prune.p4rank reads `git ls-files`).
# Ignored here: what no text model can learn from. Ignored by TYPE, never by directory, so a run's logs,
# readings, tables and notes are kept wherever they land and only its binaries stay out.
# Seeded by the vlds plugin (hooks/p4-layout.sh) when the repository has no .gitignore; the owner's edits win.

